BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:United Arts Wake County
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261107T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261107T220000
DTSTAMP:20260805T202322Z
CREATED:20260805T202322Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260805T202322Z
UID:10010209-1794079800-1794088800@unitedarts.org
SUMMARY:Rosencrantz and Guildenstern Are Dead
DESCRIPTION:Two minor characters from Hamlet suddenly find themselves at the center of one of theatre’s funniest and imaginative comedies and Stoppard’s most well known work. As the two lead characters search for answers\, they encounter actors\, royalty\, pirates\, impossible coincidences\, and a world that never quite explains itself or lets them in on the full story. Filled with fast-paced wordplay\, unforgettable performances\, and surprising heart\, Tom Stoppard’s modern classic is less about Shakespeare and more about all of us trying to figure out where we fit. It’s an exhilarating evening of actor-driven performances that celebrates the joy\, wit\, and wonder of live theatre. \nBy Tom Stoppard \n  \nDirected by Jeri Lynn Schulke \nScenic Design by Sonya Drum \nCostume Design by Jenny Mitchell \nLighting Design by Darby Madewell \nStage Management by Lauren Montana
URL:https://unitedarts.org/calendar/rosencrantz-and-guildenstern-are-dead/2026-11-07/
LOCATION:Raleigh Little Theatre\, 301 Pogue St\, Raleigh\, 27607
ORGANIZER;CN="Raleigh Little Theatre":MAILTO:boxoffice@raleighlittletheatre.org
END:VEVENT
