DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261108T153000
DTSTAMP:20261106T195612Z
CREATED:20260805T184111Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261106T195612Z
UID:10010135-1794144600-1794151800@unitedarts.org
SUMMARY:Artspace Open Studio
DESCRIPTION:Let your imagination soar in Artspace’s Open Studio and enjoy a free self-guided art making activity for ages 5 and up
URL:https://unitedarts.org/calendar/artspace-open-studio-59/
LOCATION:Artspace\, 201 East Davie Street\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27601\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://unitedarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/62ade3328b4a11c4a264a6068f471c0d.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:United Arts Wake County
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261108T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261108T170000
DTSTAMP:20260727T172315Z
CREATED:20260727T172315Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260727T172315Z
UID:10010095-1794150000-1794157200@unitedarts.org
SUMMARY:America 250
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate America’s 250th Birthday with us as we present patriotic works by American composers\, featuring “The Song of Democracy” by Howard Hanson (on a poem of Walt Whitman)\, “The Promise of Living” by Aaron Copland\, and the final movement of Michael Daugherty’s “Mount Rushmore” (dedicated to Abraham Lincoln).
URL:https://unitedarts.org/calendar/america-250/
LOCATION:Meymandi Concert Hall\, Martin Marietta Center for the Performing Arts\, 2 E. South Street\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27601\, United States
CATEGORIES:Concert
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://unitedarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/America-250-5x7-RGB.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="North Carolina Master Chorale":MAILTO:samantha@ncmasterchorale.org
END:VEVENT
